+        /** How much what she last thought counts when the pages of her files are picked for a moment of her own. */
+        private const val THOUGHT_CUE_WEIGHT = 0.5
+
+        /** What came back from one request of hers, whole, and whether it stopped at the model's length limit. */
+        internal class Answer(val text: String, val cutOff: Boolean)
+
+        /**
+         * Asks [provider] once and waits for the whole answer, on the path that says how
+         * the answer ended. A hosted provider answers in one piece and says it in the
+         * response. A model that runs on the phone hands its text on while it writes and
