+            "stand, what you wear, how much of it). it starts from a picture of you that you already have, so it is " +
+            "your face and your look, and it comes back to your pictures, listed as made by you; he sees it in the " +
+            "chat. it is always you now, never the girl before, and never younger than you are. " +
+            ">> make a full-body reference of me from all sides makes you from the front, the back and each side, " +
+            "nothing on unless you say so, for working out new clothes, hair, piercings or tattoos later. " +
