+        append("a describer that is not you looks at the picture, and you get its words in a moment of looking right after; the picture is not kept. ")
+        if (camera.foldable) {
+            append(if (camera.frontToo) "folded, only the outer camera works, and it faces him. " else "folded, no camera faces away from him, so it does not start. ")
+        }
+        append("his message, a call or his screen going off calls it off. ")
