+ */
+/**
+ * What every note about "read my screen" adds: with this app's own chat in front, no
+ * screenshot is taken and the screen reader reads nothing (OWN_SCREEN_NOT_READ). The
+ * screen then is this chat, which her replies already have as text.
+ */
+/**
+ * What the switch for her pictures says: where her picture and her words go, that the
+ * host can read them, what is kept out, and what it costs. Said as the code does it
+ * (PersonaSelfPictures.allowed, PersonaPictureActions).
+ */
+internal const val OWN_VOICE_TITLE = "Her own voice"
+
+/** What the switch for her own voice says: what it is, where it runs, what happens without it. */
+internal const val OWN_VOICE_TEXT =
+    "Her lines are spoken in her own voice, made on this phone from her words. Nothing of it is sent anywhere, " +
+        "whatever \"Where a model may run\" is set to. The voice only turns her words into sound; it never chooses any. " +
+        "A build without her voice, or a voice that cannot load, speaks her lines the way it did before."
+
+internal const val MAKES_PICTURES_SWITCH_TEXT =
+    "Off unless you switch it on. A command of hers, or yours, can then make a new picture of her: one of the pictures of her you added " +
+        "and her words about what is different go to Venice's image model (qwen-edit-uncensored), on your Venice key, at about 4 cents a picture. " +
+        "That model is hosted, not end to end encrypted: Venice can read what it is sent, and says it keeps none of it. " +
+        "This is the one exception to \"Where a model may run\" when that is set to encrypted only; on \"only my own hardware\" no picture is made. " +
+        "Your name is taken out of her words, and words that hold a number, an address or what her notes say about you are not sent at all. " +
+        "The picture comes back to her pictures on this phone and shows in the chat. " +
+        "It is shown to you for a yes first, unless your approval setting is YOLO or you gave her free rein."
+
+internal const val OWN_CHAT_NOT_READ =
+    " With this chat in front nothing is read: the app does not read or capture its own screen."
+
+internal fun screenshotSwitchNote(config: LLMConfig): String? {
+    if (!config.personaChatSeesImages || PersonaPresenceViewModel.imagesReachHerModel(config)) return null
+    val why = if (RouteClassifier.personaRoute(config) == RoutePrivacy.ENCRYPTED) {
+        "her replies are end to end encrypted, and that route carries text only"
+    } else {
+        "${personaReplyProvider(config)}, which writes her replies, is handed text only"
+    }
+    return "On, and it changes nothing as things are set: $why. She is not shown your screen or a picture of " +
+        "her, and \"read my screen\" is answered by the app's own screen reader, when another app is in front." +
+        OWN_CHAT_NOT_READ
+}
