+ * what is checked is the plain text the enclave reads, after every layer of the app
+ * has had its say.
+ *
+ * A chat of his is played through her reply as the loop writes it
+ * (AgentLoop.executeSimpleQuery: its stored rows, its history, her prompt, her request),
+ * her notebook passes come when they are due, then a moment of her own with no message
