+        LLMError.MalformedResponse, LLMError.SafeFallbackUnavailable, LLMError.ProviderUnrecognized,
+        LLMError.PrivateRouteRequired, LLMError.PlainHttpRefused, LLMError.EncryptedModelOnPlainProvider,
+        LLMError.EncryptedModelAtOtherAddress, LLMError.AddressMissing, LLMError.ProviderRefused,
